'''Unholy Tempest (Insane)''' is the 8th [[:Category:Cyclone Stages|Cyclone Stage]]. It was added in [[Version 5.6 Update|Version 5.6]] and appears every Tuesday. Upon completion, players have a 30% chance to unlock [[Cheerleader Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Cheerleader Cat]]. This is a [[No Continues]] stage.

