*8 [[Zang Roo]]s spawn after 266.67 seconds<sup>8,000f</sup>, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Using either anti-Zombie [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Ubers]] or fast units that can move behind Zyclone while it is dead can help win this stage. Because the Zyclone is not counted as a [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] enemy, this increases the difficulty of the stage, because then [[:Category:Anti-Zombie Cats|anti-Zombie units]] are almost certainly required for this stage. Thankfully, this stage exclusively features them, so said units can still be put to good use. Since Zyclone will respawn at full health after 4 seconds if he isn't Z-killed, you'll have to either do that or somehow sneak behind him, which can be difficult with all the support as it only takes a little amount of time for this to happen. For this reason, a high-leveled Holy Blast, while not necessary, can help trivializing the stage.

Due to the Zyclone's slow speed and low range, knockbacking and freezing it will make it powerless. Make sure to protect your units from other zombie units!

Try to destroy the base before the Zang Roos appear, as they will likely cause problems unless you have counters ready.

